    <!-- Android will not grant a tree on Download itself, which is why the
         panel offers the files as well as the folder. -->
    <string name="roms_none_found">No .rom files in that folder, or in the folders inside it. Choose the folder your ROMs are in, or the files themselves \u2014 Android will not allow Download as a folder.</string>
