    <string name="roms_searching">Looking for ROMs\u2026</string>
    <string name="roms_download_title">Download ROMs</string>
    <string name="roms_download_warning">This fetches a set of ZX Spectrum ROM images from archive.org, about 350 kB, and unpacks them into the ROMs folder.\n\nThe ROMs themselves are not this app\u2019s to give away: they are Sinclair and Amstrad copyright. Whether you may download and use them depends on the law where you are, and that is your responsibility.\n\nContinue?</string>
